ust stick to those indices.\n\nRevisiting Speaker 1: "Oh, coming through..." - Could be interpreted as a startled reaction, leaning towards **fear/surprise**.\nRevisiting Speaker 3: "...damage is pretty much contained..." - This is a serious report. If the context implies bad news, it could be interpreted as **sadness/concern**.\n\nIf we assume the test designer interpreted:\nSpeaker 1 $\rightarrow$ Fear (due to the initial startled "Oh")\nSpeaker 3
