ore, D is the most plausible choice, assuming the agent's professional demeanor is interpreted as suppressed frustration.\n\nFinal check: Speaker 1 is highly frustrated. Speaker 2 is procedural. Option D claims both are frustrated. This is the best fit among the given choices, prioritizing the clear emotion of Speaker 1.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{D}$
