strumental works.\n5.  **Evaluate Choice D:** "experimental music is always longer in duration than classical pieces." This is factually incorrect. Many experimental pieces are very short, and many classical pieces (symphonies, concertos) are very long.\n\n**Conclusion:** Choice A provides the most accurate and fundamental contrast between the general characteristics of experimental music (which the audio suggests) and traditional classical music regarding structure and adherence to rules.\n\nAnswer: $\boxed{A}$
